<Base title="About" description="About Pham Huy Hoang (HoangBeard), a security engineer focused on DevSecOps, cloud security and AI security.">
  <h1 class="shine">Hi, I'm Hoang.</h1>
  <div class="prose about">
    <p>
      I'm a security engineer based in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. I have spent 8+ years in cybersecurity and 10+ years
      in IT, working on infrastructure, cloud and software delivery for banks, fintech and tech companies.
    </p>
    <p>
      My main focus is DevSecOps and cloud security, and I'm now learning AI security. I like security that fits into
      the way teams already work: checks that run in the pipeline, infrastructure written as code, software that
      comes from trusted sources, and access that is easy to track.
    </p>
    <h2>Why this site</h2>
    <p>
      I learn best by doing, and I remember best by writing things down. This is where I share those notes, labs and
      tools, so others can learn from them too.
    </p>
    <h2>The name</h2>
    <p>
      "HoangBeard" is Hoang, my Vietnamese name, plus the beard I have worn for years. My friends call me "Hoang Râu",
      which means "Hoang the Beard". In English, I go by Rex.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/hoangbeard">GitHub</a> and
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hoangbeard/">LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

